{"unit_id":"Hilbert-beinghappy__dsh-plugin-auxiliary-runtime#card-zh","repo":"Hilbert-beinghappy/dsh-plugin-auxiliary-runtime","commit":"e04d37376d426276e83241fd34f1e4e441c54e81","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Auxiliary Runtime 为 DeepSeek Harness 提供可取消的辅助模型调用运行时，供同一 Host 进程中的插件使用。它通过 Host 的 llm、Session 和 storageDomain 服务准备无工具模型请求，并把调用状态与用量写入独立持久账本。插件可按会话设置并发次数、调用次数和 token 上限，查询官方、辅助及合并用量快照，也能取消活动调用。运行时处理重放、异常中断恢复、输入校验和用量预留。适合需要在主会话之外生成辅助内容、又要保留用量来源并限制资源的 DSH 插件。需要兼容的 Harness Host 服务；模型配置由 Host 提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:11-38","src/runtime.ts:160-223","src/host.ts:38-46"]}
{"unit_id":"Hilbert-beinghappy__dsh-plugin-auxiliary-runtime#card-en","repo":"Hilbert-beinghappy/dsh-plugin-auxiliary-runtime","commit":"e04d37376d426276e83241fd34f1e4e441c54e81","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Auxiliary Runtime lets same-process DSH plugins make cancelable model calls through Host services. It stores call and usage records, applies per-session concurrency, call-count, and token limits, and reports official, auxiliary, and combined usage. It requires compatible Harness services.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:11-38","src/runtime.ts:160-223","src/host.ts:38-46"]}
